            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is located in Adams County, Pennsylvania and was erected in 2000. The monument is in the municipality of Gettysburg in Pennsylvania and is categorised as a contributing property. Southwest of Adams County lies Frederick County Maryland."
